WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the 68-second introduction. Times match chewz-intro-68s.
If the narration comes back at a different pace, these are the only
thing that has to move.

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.600
Roya Publication is a house
of short noir novellas —

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.700
all by Chew Z, all free.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.600
About recommends three books
under each mood.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.200
Noir, how cold it gets.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.000
Transgressive, how far past
comfort it goes.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.300
Plausible, how much could
actually happen.

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.700
Or start a series — some read
in order, some in any,

8
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.000
and each says which.

9
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.400
The Library holds every story.

10
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.800
A cover, a line about what is inside,
and how long it takes.

11
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.100
Every cover opens —
front and back.

12
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.000
The Listening Room is the same
collection, read aloud.

13
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.200
Choose a title and it asks:
listen here, or download.

14
00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.400
Listen here, and the book opens
beside the voice —

15
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.600
each sentence lighting
as it is spoken.

16
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.600
At the foot of the page,
write back.

17
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.000
Say what you thought.
Chew Z reads every one.

18
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.400
Chewzfiction dot com.
